{"c":"431049","n":"RADBUZA 5","t":"M","s":"ZČ","o":"Staňkov","url":"431049-radbuza-5","stav":"2026-10-04","popis":"GPS Z: 49°34'10.201\"N, 13°4'55.567\"E, K: 49°32'9.584\"N, 12°58'35.747\"E\nPřítok Berounky. Od jezu mlýna v Ohučově (ř. km 50,4) až k jezu mlýna Semošice (ř. km 62,6). K revíru patří úsek potoka Zubřina (GPS Z: 49°32'46.774\"N, 13°3'50.077\"E, K: 49°32'12.733\"N, 13°3'11.191\"E) od ústí do Radbuzy (ř. km 53,7) až k jezu mlýna Pasecký pod Osvračínem (ř. km 2,5).\nK revíru patří všechny přítoky mimo tzv. Vartovy tůně u jezu v Křenovech. V obecném zájmu je zakázán lov ryb na levém břehu řeky ve Staňkově v úseku 50 m nad a 30 m pod jezem u Malého mlýna.","delka":12,"rozloha":16,"lat":49.550725,"lon":13.029367,"mo_web":"https://www.rybsvaz.cz/mo/-/stankov","mo_tel":"724 634 869","mo_mail":"crsstankov@centrum.cz","doba":[{"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-12-31","h":"05:00–22:00","zakaz":false}],"kratkodobe":[],"miry":[{"d":"Amur bílý","min":50,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Bolen dravý","min":40,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Candát obecný","min":45,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Cejn velký","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Hlavatka obecná","min":65,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec jesen","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":true,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec tloušť","min":25,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jeseter malý","min":30,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Kapr obecný","min":40,"max":70,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Lín obecný","min":20,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Lipan podhorní","min":30,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od